OL,3,GNEWSARobbie Savage: Colourful character
OL,4,Aset to spice up Posh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs famous for his blond locks and big
OL,7,Fpersonality as his football, Robbie
OL,8,FSavage has long divided the football
OL,9,Fworld.
OL,11,FFrom Premier League pitches to the
OL,12,FStrictly dancefloor, he has never been
OL,13,Fone to shy away from the limelight.
OL,15,FSo as he is appointed to his biggest
OL,16,Fmanagerial job yet at Peterborough
OL,17,FUnited, could he be the colourful
OL,18,Fcharacter needed to spice up Posh?
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
