OL,3,GNEWSARobbie Savage: Colourful character
OL,4,Aset to spice up Posh
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes at a time when other big names
OL,7,Fhave helped drum up interest in some of
OL,8,Ffootball's less fashionable clubs -
OL,9,Fthink Ryan Reynolds' ownership of
OL,10,FWrexham and Ed Sheeran taking a stake
OL,11,Fin Ipswich Town.
